{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"坦桑尼亚","country_iso":"TZA","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:15:08.195357","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"TZA-PV-0005","ldc":"Yes","location":"希尼安加省","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"坦桑尼亚卡哈马二期100兆瓦光伏项目","project_name_en":"Tanzania Kahama II 100MW Solar PV Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"电建国际公司","content":"当地时间7月26日，中国电建与英国光伏电站开发商签订了坦桑尼亚卡哈马二期100兆瓦光伏项目EPC合同。\n项目位于坦桑尼亚希尼安加省卡哈马市南部，主要内容包括112.7兆瓦的太阳能光伏装机和22兆瓦储能设施。项目建成后每年将为坦桑尼亚国家电网提供约2亿千瓦时的清洁电力，为缓解坦桑尼亚电力紧张、促进当地经济社会发展提供重要支持。\n该项目是公司基于卡哈马光伏一期10兆瓦项目的二次开发。项目一期已协助业主实现融资关闭，正式进入履约阶段。该项目二期合同的签署彰显了中国电建在坦桑尼亚推动第三方市场合作的能力，进一步巩固和扩大了公司在坦桑尼亚新能源市场的影响力，为公司继续深耕坦桑尼亚新能源市场打下了坚实的基础。","content_sha256":"dd306d93a90cd55d8139ef79440dd2cf43d27c2bbd1e853da8aa3d939e8ff6ac","id":7440,"publish_date":"2024-07-30 18:55:02","title":"中国电建签约坦桑尼亚卡哈马二期100兆瓦光伏项目","title_sha256":"975328391969a7eb2c2761ed0fa74eb68f0dbddc5e0c992ee8aa80a24522ce50","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/69237.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"TZA-PV-0005","capacity_details":"PV: 112.7MW, BESS: 22MW","capacity_mw":112.7,"capacity_mw_raw":"112.7","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:15:08.195929","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"TZA-PV-0005-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.powerchina-intl.com/show/9/3732.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"英国光伏电站开发商","project_developer_en":"UK Solar Farm Developer","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国电建（中国电力建设集团有限公司）在坦桑尼亚希尼安加省卡哈马市南部签约承建卡哈马二期100兆瓦光伏